{{short description|None}}

{{GeoGroup}}
This list is of the [[Monuments of Japan|Historic Sites of Japan]] located within the {{ill|Prefectures of Japan|en|Prefectures of Japan|qid=Q50337|lt=Prefecture|1=Prefectures of Japan}} of {{ill|Shimane Prefecture|en|Shimane Prefecture|qid=Q132751|lt=Shimane|1=Shimane Prefecture}}.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.bunka.go.jp/tokei_hakusho_shuppan/shuppanbutsu/bunkazai_pamphlet/pamphlet_en.html |title=Cultural Properties for Future Generations |publisher=[[Agency for Cultural Affairs]] |accessdate=1 July 2021}}</ref>

==National Historic Sites==
As of 1 July 2021, sixty Sites have been {{ill|Cultural Property (Japan)|en|Cultural Property (Japan)|qid=Q858308|lt=designated|1=Cultural Property (Japan)}} as being of national {{ill|Values (heritage)|en|Values (heritage)|qid=Q7912786|lt=significance|1=Values (heritage)}}; the {{ill|San'indō|en|San'indō|qid=Q1323423|lt=San'indō|1=San'indō}} and [[Tsuwano Domain Kamei clan cemetery]] with the Grave of {{ill|Kamei Korenori|en|Kamei Korenori|qid=Q848778|lt=Kamei Korenori|1=Kamei Korenori}} span the prefectural borders with {{ill|Tottori Prefecture|en|Tottori Prefecture|qid=Q133935|lt=Tottori|1=Tottori Prefecture}}.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.bunka.go.jp/seisaku/bunkazai/shokai/shitei.html |script-title=ja:史跡名勝天然記念物 |trans-title=Number of Monuments of Japan by Prefecture |language=Japanese |publisher=[[Agency for Cultural Affairs]] |date=1 July 2021 |accessdate=1 July 2021}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/bsys/index |title=Database of National Cultural Properties: 史跡名勝天然記念物 (史跡, 特別史跡 島根県 ２県以上) |language=Japanese |publisher=[[Agency for Cultural Affairs]] |accessdate=1 July 2021}}</ref><ref name="Shimane">{{cite web |url=https://www.pref.shimane.lg.jp/life/bunka/bunkazai/shimane/itiran.html |script-title=ja:国・県指定文化財件数一覧 |trans-title=Number of National and Prefectural Cultural Properties |language=Japanese |publisher={{ill|Shimane Prefecture|en|Shimane Prefecture|qid=Q132751|lt=Shimane Prefecture|1=Shimane Prefecture}} |date=24 June 2021 |accessdate=1 July 2021}}</ref>

